resource-cli (resource-cli v1.0.0)

USAGE:
  resource-cli [COMMANDS] [OPTIONS]

COMMANDS:
  [resource-manager]            Resource management tool
  create --name <name>          Create a resource

For more info, run any command with the `--help` flag:
  resource-cli <COMMAND> --help

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help             Display this help message
  -v, --version          Display this version

